Neobeam is a fast, native Neovim GUI client built with Qt6 and C++.

It connects to an embedded Neovim instance via msgpack-RPC and renders
the editor using native Qt widgets: statusline, tabline, command line,
completion popup, minimap and message log are all driven by Neovim's
UI protocol extensions.

This package is built without the embedded terminal panel, which
requires qtermwidget built against Qt6.
